  "description": {
   "en": "In a world torn between light and darkness, Juniper, a lowly soldier in the Demon King's army, receives an impossible task. To mentor the fallen hero! As an unlikely bond forms between them, their connection may reshape the very fabric of their divided realm. An epic high fantasy adventure where heaven and earth collide!",
   "ja": "世界が2つに分断されし時代、魔王軍に所属する超下っ端戦闘員・ジュニパーはとんでもない使命を受けた…なんと闇堕ちした勇者の教育係になってしまったのだ！ジュニパーと勇者の絆が結ばれる刻、世界が変革を迎える――天照地暗ハイファンタジーアクション！"
  },
